'''Penny''' (Japanese: '''ボタン''' ''Botan'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter card}} in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released part of the {{TCGP|Eevee Grove}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=Look at a random {{TCGP|Supporter card}} that's not Penny from your opponent's deck and shuffle it back into their deck. Use the effect of that card as the effect of this card.
}}

