==Trivia==
*{{TCG|Penny}} also exists in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but with a different effect.

===Origin===
*[[Penny]] is a student at [[Naranja Academy]]{{sup/9|S}}/[[Uva Academy]]{{sup/9|V}}.
*Both of this card's {{TCGP|Paldean Wonders}} illustrations were first featured on {{TCG ID|Scarlet & Violet|Penny|183}} from the {{TCG|Scarlet & Violet}} expansion.

